{"id":"wikibooks:chickpea-omelette","verdict":"keep","recipes":[{"source":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook%3AChickpea_Omelette","status":"fixed","reason":"Remove image caption markup from cooking steps.","ingredients":["1 cup chickpea flour","1 teaspoon baking powder","Salt","1 teaspoon ground turmeric","1 teaspoon paprika","1 cup soy milk or water","1 tablespoon olive oil"],"steps":["In a bowl, mix the chickpea flour, baking powder, salt, turmeric, and paprika until combined.","Gradually add in the soy milk, and mix until the batter is fully combined.","Heat up a skillet on medium heat and add the olive oil. Spread the oil across the pan and let it heat up a little.","Pour the batter into the skillet. Cook until bubbles form in the middle. Then, carefully flip using a spatula.","Cook the other side for about 30 seconds.","Serve."]}]}
